{{Unobtainable}}
'''Otaku Geek Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]]. He is a variant of [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] that has the [[Weaken|weaken]] ability instead of [[Slow|slow]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 429
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Otaku Geek Cat
|name2 = Hacker Geek Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hacker Geek Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hacker Geek Cat acts like a second [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] with a few differences. Instead of slowing enemies down, Hacker Geek Cat weakens them. Similarly, they provide long distance support from a safe distance, even able to hit backliners with huge range.

Hacker Geek Cat has a low uptime of 33%, making it almost required to create a Hacker Geek Cat stack to get 100% weaken uptime. This makes Hacker Geek Cat rather ineffective as a support on his own, unless you have other means of keeping enemies away from his very large blind spot. Unlike Cyberpunk Cat, Hacker Geek Cat can't prevent them from doing so on his own.

However, when paired with Cyberpunk Cat, the two can provide excellent support from a huge range while complementing each other; Cyberpunk Cat provides support to prevent enemies from advancing when Hacker Geek Cat hinder enemies from fighting properly when your units engage them. Do note that if you choose to use other debuffer cats like [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] or [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Headmaster Cat Jobs]], there's not really any point in bringing him to battle.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

